WEBVTT

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:02.350
Mars Upper Atmosphere

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.790
When I was little...

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:04.640
Mars Upper Atmosphere

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:07.190
I spotted a baby crow about to fall out of its nest.

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:10.000
Satellite Base Meganebula

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.230
I stretched my hand out towards it from the window...

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:12.650
Satellite Base Meganebula

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:14.150
but I couldn't reach it at all.

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:14.200
Satellite Base Meganebula

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:18.100
I thought to myself, "if only my arm were longer."

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:22.100
I wished I had a hand that could've saved that bird.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:23.200
Though... the mama bird came right then...

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.890
Fraternity HQ

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:27.340
and saved it anyway.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:27.960
Fraternity HQ

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.800
This soot just doesn't want to come off.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:42.640
If you'd been any closer to that explosion, you'd be charred enough to look like a crow.

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:43.600
What's a crow?

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:46.190
Oh right, there aren't any on Mars.

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:49.480
Have you been to Earth? ...Of course not.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:50.710
The Earth?!

00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:54.610
Oh yeah, they fly around all over the place, enough so to get in your way.

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:58.700
There are that many? Does that mean the Earth's sky is always pitch black?

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:01.380
No, the sky's blue, but...

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:06.210
Ooh, it's full of blue birds!

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:13.620
Groovin' magic

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.010
yorisoeba itsudemo
Whenever we're close to each other

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:23.650
kitsuku musunda kutsuhimo ga mune wo kyun to saseru
My firmly tied shoelaces make my heart twinge

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:46.040
se no takai anata ga mioroshite iru no yo
You're looking down on me from your tall height

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:51.000
sotto kami wo naderu furi wo shite
I quietly pretend to stroke my hair

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:56.310
chikadzuite ki wo hikitai no
hoping to get closer and catch your eye

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:02.510
"dou shita no?" tte jirasanaide
"What's the matter?" Don't give me that

00:02:02.510 --> 00:02:07.970
koi no countdown junbei wa itsudemo OK
Countdown to love, I'm ready anytime

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:09.710
3, 2, 1, futari wa...
3, 2, 1, we're...

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:12.660
Groovin' magic

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:15.650
soda sui ni tokeru
Soluble in soda water

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:23.070
amaku setsunai koi no iro mune no kyun to saseru
The bittersweet color of love makes my heart twinge

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:47.170
It's full of blue birds!

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:55.850
Peeping, aren't you?

00:02:55.850 --> 00:03:00.560
This is trouble... You're gonna get in trouble, Mr. Casio.

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:04.230
Th-There's nothing wrong with this! I mean, come on, she's a robot!

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:07.190
You've got a point. Ah, I see now.

00:03:07.630 --> 00:03:11.600
A mecha-girl's <i>moe</i> is totally different from a loli-girl's <i>moe</i>, huh?

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:14.110
N-No, that's not what I...

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.690
You might not see them much in home territory...

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:21.580
but unregistered robots like that are pretty common around Pluto.

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:23.960
Nicola, you find this interesting?

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:27.880
Hm? Mr. Casio... You don't like 'em like this?

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:31.530
Ahh, you must be into the flat-chested type.

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:35.770
Hm? Are those the guys from Mars?

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:39.180
Mars Warning & Control Force (15th Grand Fleet)

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:40.190
First Inspection Squadron

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:42.230
What a pain...
First Inspection Squadron

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:42.240
First Inspection Squadron

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:44.920
It's not like Lunar Tokyo's been attacked.

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:46.960
So you say, but this is the first time...

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:51.070
a space monster has made it as far as the surface of a planet.

00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:52.950
That's a pretty big deal to them.

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:55.930
And we could be held responsible.

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:59.910
A run-of-the-mill part-timer robot throwing herself into danger like that...

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:03.790
Still, your skin's no different from that of a normal girl.

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:07.290
That hurts a little, Onee-sama...

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:08.460
Why're you calling me Onee-sama?

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:13.240
Well, because you're a hero of justice who protects the people!

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:17.920
And when you beat that space monster, my heart was pounding!

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:20.180
Onee-sama, doesn't your heart pound?

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:24.780
W-Well, not really. I'm a hero of justice, after all.

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:28.620
Episode 2: I Don't Want to Be an Onee-sama

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:32.350
I know not my birthplace nor my lineage!

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:37.240
I am Nono, a never-do-well raised in the Valles Marineris on Mars!

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:40.890
Ladies and gentleman of the Fraternity, please find it in your hearts...

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:42.020
to induct me into your family...

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:42.730
and share your sake cup with me!

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:44.580
What's that? Rock-paper-scissors?

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:48.500
I want to become a space pilot like Onee-sama!

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:49.140
I do, I do, I do!

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:52.090
She looks big, but she acts like such a kid.

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.570
Sounds kinda familiar.

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:54.470
Me?!

00:04:54.780 --> 00:04:56.290
I find her interesting.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.180
How so?

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:01.470
Isn't she entertaining? You saw that Rider Kick she did.

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:02.710
That's "Lightning."

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:04.760
It was cracked to start with, that's all.

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:08.000
Really! Fighting when you're "Topless," you can't do it with anything...

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.820
less than complete determination, can you?

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:11.610
See? She's entertaining.

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:15.350
Oh, hey. They grew sick of waiting and now they're signaling us.

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:21.020
They want to hear the situation directly from the monster investigator who was on the scene.

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:21.970
Not touchin' this.

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:25.790
Princess Lal'C, you'll handle this nicely for us, won't you?

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.740
Come over here for a sec...

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:32.540
Wh-What?

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:40.580
Your reward for beating the space monster.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:44.390
You're irate since I didn't do this as usual, aren't you?

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:48.260
The sound of a heartbeat... It somehow calms me down.

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:51.610
You're the only one I can depend on as well, Princess.

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:56.110
The Princess? To the inspection ship?

00:05:56.110 --> 00:06:00.430
Yeah. It's mostly a formality, though she'll have to be questioned.

00:06:00.430 --> 00:06:01.640
Onee-sama will?

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:09.750
Onee-sama, I heard you were being taken away somewhere!

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:10.960
Wh-What?

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:13.510
Mr. Nicola told me.

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:14.350
Nicola did?

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:16.050
Yes, Onee-sama!

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.850
I'm not your Onee-sama.

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:28.260
Ow... owwie...

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:34.650
If you want to fight with us, you'll have to pilot a Buster Machine.

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:36.480
A Buster Machine...

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:40.280
Like I said... You wouldn't make it.

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:56.440
When opening the airlock, please verify that the inner gate is sealed.

00:06:57.550 --> 00:07:00.470
When opening the airlock...

00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:18.510
Onee-sama's Buster Machine... Wow!

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:22.220
So many scars...

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:25.040
Buster Machine, <i>Dix-Neuf</i>.

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:31.340
It's the oldest out of all the Buster Machines currently in service...

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:32.890
a seasoned veteran hero.

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:36.780
You sure it's okay to let her snoop around?

00:07:36.780 --> 00:07:42.190
It's unheard of for <i>Dix-Neuf</i> to disobey Lal'C like it did in the previous battle.

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:45.420
Maybe it was in reaction to that girl...

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:51.800
Great timing. If Lal'C were here, she probably wouldn't want to use <i>Dix-Neuf</i>.

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:55.580
H-Hold on here, there can't be a robot Topless!

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:03.220
Being Topless means manifesting a heightened mental state.

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:05.360
It's been theorized that...

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:09.950
as long as it has a sense of self and intelligence, even an AI has the potential to become Topless.

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:13.020
There's just no precedent for it yet.

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:16.290
Miss Nono, can you speak with <i>Dix-Neuf</i>?

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:17.380
Speak?

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:19.510
If you're Topless, you should be able to.

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:21.970
I'm supposed to take off my top here, right?

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:26.640
Let her undress.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:44.460
Flagship <i>Lalahcharn</i> (026SS)

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:50.800
It's a girl... Oh man, she's seriously cute!

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:53.200
Even in the Fraternity, she's a Candian elite!

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:56.230
Hasn't she held the highest score out of all the Topless for the past 2 years?

00:08:56.230 --> 00:08:59.080
I've seen her on TV! She's done swearing-in ceremonies too.

00:09:01.510 --> 00:09:04.490
You've kept us waiting far too long, Lal'C Mellk Mal.

00:09:05.610 --> 00:09:08.800
I'm the one in charge of this investigation...

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:11.570
Captain Hatori.

00:09:12.140 --> 00:09:14.010
C-Could I have your autograph?

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:15.110
Me too, please!

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:17.350
So cute! Even her autograph's cute!

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:23.890
An unknown type slipped past us by using meteorites as camouflage.

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:25.710
There's nothing else to explain.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.650
Sorry. You'll have to be handcuffed, it's regulation.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:32.540
Use of Topless capabilities while onboard a military ship is strictly prohibited.

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:35.790
We can't have you removing that seal on your forehead, after all.

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:37.580
What a pathetic excuse for an adult.

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:43.870
Even I was once Topless when I was a kid, just like everyone else.

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:48.100
I got it in my head that I could pilot a Buster Machine and become a hero...

00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:52.940
Though I was never good enough for the Fraternity to bother contacting me.

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:57.100
Due to that, I managed to wake up and smell the coffee before it was too late.

00:09:57.890 --> 00:10:00.260
You know Nicolas Vacheron, right?

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:04.700
Was it him who instructed you to make landfall on Mars?

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:09.250
No. The Fraternity doesn't have that sort of command structure.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:13.610
Perhaps he knew about it in advance?

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:18.560
Even I had no positive proof. Nicola really didn't know.

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:19.710
Mm-hmm...

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:23.260
Perhaps his "expiration" day is drawing nearer.

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:29.710
It's true that the Topless are the only force protecting mankind from the space monsters.

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:33.860
After all, even the Buster Machines are nothing more than servants to you.

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:45.290
That control heart acts as both a cockpit and a power generator.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:53.190
The super energy for the Exotic Maneuver that overwhelms space monsters...

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:55.020
is supplied by the Topless themselves.

00:10:56.200 --> 00:11:00.570
Do you prefer it sweetened? I can tell, since I was that way once.

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:02.680
I don't like coffee.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:03.380
Hm.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:09.550
But there's another school of thought out there.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:14.110
That the Topless being here is the reason for the space monsters' attacks.

00:11:14.510 --> 00:11:15.850
Why's that?

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:19.160
Even in old records, it shows that the space monsters started attacking again...

00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:22.560
at roughly the same time as when the Topless first made their appearance.

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:27.810
My take on the matter is... Maybe you both are the same.

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:31.150
You're both mankind's enemies.

00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:36.650
I intend to recommend for the garrison treaty for the Fraternity in Meganebula...

00:11:36.650 --> 00:11:38.120
to be revoked.

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:41.550
With this new, state-of-the-art battleship fleet...

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:44.650
there's no need of any irregular forces around Mars.

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:52.960
It's not working. We're not observing any Clefshin luminescence...

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:56.130
nor any powder particle reaction.

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:57.760
Oh, is that so.

00:11:58.930 --> 00:12:00.310
What? What?

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:06.110
What is it?! ...Hm? A space monster?!

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:30.100
This is a space monster alert.

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:32.010
What? What's going on?

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:36.220
Gravitational flux detected. It's going to warp out.

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:39.330
Area 537-A? That close?!

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:42.000
Could it be trying to recover the last one that showed up on Mars?

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:42.970
Quite possibly.

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:44.450
Let's call the Princess back.

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:47.660
They're going out to pick a fight with it!

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:49.200
With the Princess still on board?!

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:07.100
Retreat immediately! It's our of your league, Captain!

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:08.220
Don't write us off so quickly.

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:12.360
This is a cutting-edge anti-monster tactical fleet. We'll take it down.

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:13.820
Minus 3 degrees...

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:15.330
Focused ripples in the oscillating ether waves.

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:15.890
Confirmed through infrared and gravitational wave...

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:17.350
Enemy warp out confirmed!

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:17.640
Confirmed through infrared and gravitational wave...

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:19.050
All ships, activate anti-electromagnetism defenses!

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:21.400
Theater control system, activate.
...Beastron 3, A-type, male.

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:22.870
You're certain about that?

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:25.360
The space monster, Beastron class, is acting alone!

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:28.700
It's on a direct course for this ship! Distance, 15,000!

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:31.540
Let us handle this! You can't handle it!

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:35.290
Don't listen to her. Open all cannon ports! Prepare for starboard cannon volley!

00:13:35.570 --> 00:13:40.250
Open all cannon ports! Prepare for starboard cannon volley!

00:13:48.940 --> 00:13:52.420
Target acquired. Automatic tracking system set.

00:13:52.420 --> 00:13:54.780
Laser cannons, bolt locks released.

00:13:54.780 --> 00:13:57.010
Calculated error adjustment, 012.

00:13:57.010 --> 00:13:57.670
Activate photonic electromagnetic wave 1...

00:13:57.670 --> 00:14:00.900
All cannons, open fire! Fire another volley 15 seconds later!

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:03.570
First, we'll pin the space monster down!

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.370
Alright!

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:23.850
Electromagnetic noise detected! Presently confirming...

00:14:23.850 --> 00:14:27.590
Now, all ships, prepare to accelerate! We'll charge in and take it down!

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:29.290
Prepare torpedo launch tubes!

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:32.010
Enemy silhouette acquired!

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:34.350
No change in velocity! No confirmation of any damage!

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:44.300
Move... Move, <i>Dix-Neuf</i>!

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:47.950
Please, <i>Dix-Neuf</i>! Take me to Onee-sama!

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:55.700
We've been attacked by the enemy space monster!

00:14:56.050 --> 00:14:58.230
Several direct hits taken. Damage is severe!

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:00.750
The <i>Lalaway</i>'s taken engine damage. It's dropping out of the battle!

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.740
This is a torpedo battle. We can still make it through this!

00:15:02.740 --> 00:15:03.930
You can't take any more of this.

00:15:03.930 --> 00:15:05.420
Direct hit to stern!

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:06.070
There's a fire in route #7, starboard! Activate the automated fire extinguishers!

00:15:06.070 --> 00:15:07.100
Do you get it now?

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:07.940
There's a fire in route #7, starboard! Activate the automated fire extinguishers!

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:11.270
The Topless are the only ones that can defeat the space monsters.

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:12.810
...So what?!

00:15:13.960 --> 00:15:15.650
Space monster, incoming!

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:35.000
Hurry up and turn around! We have to reorganize!

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:37.000
Captain! We can't control the ship!

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:37.910
What?

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:39.930
We're being hacked!

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:41.210
It's not just this ship!

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:44.090
Irregularities in the brainwaves of every cyber-whale in the fleet confirmed!

00:15:44.090 --> 00:15:46.260
It's no good! It's going out of control!

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.800
What the hell's going on?

00:15:57.800 --> 00:15:59.950
Wavefunctions are registering unrestraint!

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:02.350
A physics disruption phenomenon! It's a Topless!

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:04.400
That's the Buster Megatech PK!

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:05.740
Him?!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.750
Let's give them a chance to shine, shall we?

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:31.670
<i>Vingt-Sept</i>, take-off.

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:35.470
Exotic Maneuver!

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:43.980
Buster Machine · <i>Vingt-Sept</i>

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:58.720
We're being controlled by the Buster Machine!

00:16:58.720 --> 00:17:00.010
Is he trying to kill us?

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:03.080
It's Nicola's Exotic Maneuver!

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:07.100
Ka-boom! Whoosh, zoom! Bang, pow!

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:11.790
All right, Space Force battleships, you guys ready?

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:15.590
It's time to wrap this up. One, two...

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:17.030
KABLOOIE!

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:29.800
What sort of way to fight is this?!

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:33.090
Ngh! And... there we go.

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:37.040
What are you doing?! Stop! You're in violation of treaty!

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:41.360
Would you shut up? I'm going to play with Nicola.

00:17:43.860 --> 00:17:44.700
<i>Dix-Neuf</i>!

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:50.520
Hurry up and get out of there! It's about to begin quantization!

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:51.670
Eh?

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.630
You idiot! Not in here!

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:06.280
Stop, please...

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:21.540
Onee-sama! Let's fight together!

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:24.160
Take that! And that, and that, and...

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:24.830
Hey...

00:18:27.240 --> 00:18:29.280
What the hell? Come on...

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:38.940
Hey!

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:41.540
Get that huge ass of yours out of my way!

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:47.350
Man, you're one tomboyish princess, smashing through a hull like that...

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:49.940
Now, we'll chase down that space monster.

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:51.080
Right.

00:18:55.430 --> 00:18:57.840
Onee-sama... That ship...

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:59.450
Hold on tight!

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:12.190
Buster...

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:16.350
BEAM!!!

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:18.630
It's fast!

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:30.350
It's a quick one...

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:34.140
Okay, Princess, let's use the Buster X Attack. You can do it, right?

00:19:34.140 --> 00:19:35.980
We'll get a chance when it approaches again.

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:37.790
Of course!

00:19:41.640 --> 00:19:44.280
Onee-sama, that ship's in danger!

00:19:44.720 --> 00:19:48.630
Its engine is dead. If nothing stops it, it'll fall to Mars.

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:50.260
The space monster comes first!

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:52.670
We have to save them... Please, <i>Dix-Neuf</i>!

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:54.300
Don't touch that without permission!

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:56.250
<i>Dix-Neuf</i> says he wants to save them, too...

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:59.300
<i>Dix-Neuf</i> only does what I tell him to.

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:01.730
Right now, I have a perfect chance with Nicola to...

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:04.810
Onee-sama, aren't you a hero of justice?

00:20:04.810 --> 00:20:07.180
If it were Nono-Riri, she'd save them for sure!

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:10.310
A hero of justice would go and save them right now!

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:13.560
What's the matter? Focus! The space monster's coming!

00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:18.150
You know the drill, right, Princess? Respond!

00:20:19.640 --> 00:20:20.650
Princess!

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:23.260
<i>Dix-Neuf</i>!

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:27.050
Onee-sama!

00:20:27.050 --> 00:20:28.630
Wait! Get back here!

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.270
Lal'C, oh for...

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:52.060
Can't you restart the main engine yet?!

00:20:53.030 --> 00:20:56.600
Our rate of descent is too fast... There's no stopping it now.

00:20:57.070 --> 00:21:00.900
That much mass, at that angle of entry... It's too much, even for Dix-Neuf.

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:03.160
He can't support that much.

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:32.150
Nono! Please!

00:21:32.610 --> 00:21:34.140
Yes, Onee-sama!

00:21:36.240 --> 00:21:38.270
Go, <i>Dix-Neuf</i>!

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:06.430
Holy crap...

00:22:36.450 --> 00:22:39.340
I could still handle it...

00:22:40.580 --> 00:22:41.780
<i>Vingt-Sept</i>...

00:22:54.020 --> 00:22:58.270
Captain, I'm relieved that you're safe. We'd be pleased to have you visit again.

00:22:58.850 --> 00:23:01.090
Everyone has to accept it.

00:23:01.500 --> 00:23:05.030
Even the strongest of Topless will eventually pass their expiration date.

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:10.570
You're not young anymore. There's no way for you to avoid it...

00:23:16.450 --> 00:23:21.070
How rare, to be attacked by space monsters twice in one day.

00:23:21.070 --> 00:23:24.630
Highly intriguing. That Topless girl.

00:23:24.630 --> 00:23:30.130
You twins have the wrong idea. She's not a Topless. She's just a robot.

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:31.290
Oh?

00:23:31.290 --> 00:23:33.110
I wonder if she tastes good?

00:23:33.110 --> 00:23:34.140
Nicolas...

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:35.150
Hm?

00:23:35.150 --> 00:23:37.350
We have a favor to ask...

00:23:38.330 --> 00:23:39.570
If we may?

00:23:45.920 --> 00:23:51.210
We did it, right, Onee-sama? My heart's still pounding!

00:23:52.150 --> 00:23:54.050
Do you even have a heart?

00:23:55.380 --> 00:23:56.120
Listen!

00:24:00.020 --> 00:24:00.750
See?

00:24:01.190 --> 00:24:02.250
Hm...

00:24:08.100 --> 00:24:13.330
No fair! You beat two without me!

00:24:13.330 --> 00:24:14.990
Whoa, Tycho-chan!

00:24:16.640 --> 00:24:20.890
Once again, I didn't get a turn. I've just got no luck this month!

00:24:21.240 --> 00:24:23.940
It looks good on you! Come on in here.

00:24:24.340 --> 00:24:25.380
Who's that?

00:24:25.380 --> 00:24:27.480
A new friend.

00:24:32.610 --> 00:24:36.620
I'm Nono. As of today, I will be in the Fraternity's care.

00:24:37.200 --> 00:24:39.390
I'm a single flower, a girl full of dreams...

00:24:39.750 --> 00:24:44.960
and I'm still just a trainee, but I'll stick it out with hard work and guts!

00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:52.150
Crying, laughing, I can never tell
naitari warattari itsumo wakaranai

00:24:53.810 --> 00:24:57.970
People are mysterious creatures
hito wa fushigi na ikimono

00:24:57.970 --> 00:25:02.400
Getting upset over being lonely
sabishii noni okotteru

00:25:02.400 --> 00:25:05.560
Getting upset over being happy
ureshii noni okotteru

00:25:06.580 --> 00:25:12.450
Getting lost even when they put on airs
kidottemo mayotte iru no

00:25:12.450 --> 00:25:15.050
Why is it?
doushite na no?

00:25:15.450 --> 00:25:19.140
No matter how many times you stumble
nando tsumazuichattemo

00:25:19.140 --> 00:25:24.250
Stand back up, smile, and face forward
tachiagatte sou waratte mae muite

00:25:24.250 --> 00:25:31.550
Surely when tomorrow comes, you will be a bit different
kitto ashita ni nattara sukoshi kawatte irareru

00:25:32.250 --> 00:25:35.950
Bye-bye, stardust tears
bye bye hoshikuzu namida

00:25:54.820 --> 00:25:58.410
May this feeling reach that person...
douka konna omoi ga

00:25:58.410 --> 00:26:03.070
And the world, and the universe
ano hito ni sekai ni uchuu ni made

00:26:03.070 --> 00:26:10.810
Another one spills down
todokimasu you ni tomata hitotsu koboreochiru

00:26:11.540 --> 00:26:15.430
Bye-bye, stardust tears
bye bye hoshikuzu namida

00:26:16.010 --> 00:26:20.660
Bye-bye, stardust tears
bye bye hoshikuzu namida

00:26:30.700 --> 00:26:33.690
Next Episode Preview

00:26:33.740 --> 00:26:37.190
A huge operation to ambush the enemy in Jupiter's orbit!

00:26:37.650 --> 00:26:39.220
No matter what Miss Tycho says...

00:26:39.220 --> 00:26:44.500
the latest, strongest, brand new Buster Machine will go to me, of course! Right, Onee-sama?

00:26:44.920 --> 00:26:45.710
Next time, on Gunbuster 2!

